      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 53f12dfa-5d88-5d42-b5d8-44bce759f295))
  (text "C3 value from the coin-cell bench test (220-470 uF), low-leakage, near U3."
    (at 25.4 172.72 0)
    (effects
